The following methods would require extensive modification in order to handle
binary data;
  - PINSPlus
  - moCluster
  
For PINSPlus and moCluster, logisticPCA could potentially be incorporated to
generate latent variables from binary data, but the different optimization process
(compared to each method's existing fucntionality for continuous data) makes
it hard to implement in an integrative way (so that continuous and binary data
are simultaneously updated during iterations in a smooth manner).